[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12483.51, "timestamp": "03:28:03", "text": "实际上昨天早上我一直熬夜到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12485.67, "timestamp": "03:28:05", "text": "早上7点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12488.469, "timestamp": "03:28:08", "text": "我没睡，然后我睡了，然后我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12490.71, "timestamp": "03:28:10", "text": "哦，对，合作练习一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12493.59, "timestamp": "03:28:13", "text": "今天在这里，这不是合作，而是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12495.99, "timestamp": "03:28:15", "text": "更像是一种练习"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12497.91, "timestamp": "03:28:17", "text": "就像一种间接的教我方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12500.389, "timestamp": "03:28:20", "text": "就是那件事，碰巧我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12502.63, "timestamp": "03:28:22", "text": "现场直播，我就想，好吧，那我就现场直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12504.15, "timestamp": "03:28:24", "text": "居住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12507.99, "timestamp": "03:28:27", "text": "是的，我确实征求过他们的同意，如果他们……呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12509.91, "timestamp": "03:28:29", "text": "但那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12513.67, "timestamp": "03:28:33", "text": "能够接受在直播中扮演他们的角色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12517.67, "timestamp": "03:28:37", "text": "直播中可以听到声音等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12522.229, "timestamp": "03:28:42", "text": "但我本来可以写什么呢？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12524.63, "timestamp": "03:28:44", "text": "所以，但早期的问题是，我直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12527.91, "timestamp": "03:28:47", "text": "现在可以在YouTube上观看。我说过从这个月开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12531.429, "timestamp": "03:28:51", "text": "以后我只会在我……的时候才会做YouTube视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12534.95, "timestamp": "03:28:54", "text": "积极主动地站在正确的位置。是的，有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12537.62, "timestamp": "03:28:57", "text": "那。"}]